1
00:00:00,443 --> 00:00:03,983
(Amy:)Your thoughts and ideas come
from you, not from your anxiety.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,450
(Sheldon:)Hmm, perhaps.

3
00:00:05,448 --> 00:00:07,178
(Sheldon:)But I'm not taking
the cap off.

4
00:00:08,118 --> 00:00:10,118
(Amy:)It's one thing to make
yourself miserable,

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,490
(Amy:)but you're making everyone
around you miserable, too.

6
00:00:12,489 --> 00:00:16,029
(Amy:)Now, I'm telling you for the
last time-- take the cap off.

7
00:00:16,026 --> 00:00:17,856
Oh!

8
00:00:17,861 --> 00:00:19,031
(Sheldon:)Really?

9
00:00:19,029 --> 00:00:20,829
(Sheldon:)What if I don't?

10
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:24,100
(Sheldon:)And before you answer that,
can I have my dessert?

11
00:00:25,635 --> 00:00:27,705
(Sheldon:)And then she
threw me out.

12
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:33,010
(Sheldon:)Me, her very
own boyfriend.

13
00:00:33,009 --> 00:00:35,639
(Sheldon:)When all I've done is try
to help humanity reach

14
00:00:35,645 --> 00:00:38,615
a more profound understanding
of the world we live in.

15
00:00:42,018 --> 00:00:43,188
(Man:)Yeah, well, women--

16
00:00:43,186 --> 00:00:45,086
(Man:)what are you gonna do?

17
00:00:47,991 --> 00:00:50,221
(Sheldon:)I knew you'd understand,
Armadillo Isaac Newton.

18
00:00:54,864 --> 00:00:57,494
(Leonard:)Okay...

19
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,870
(Leonard:)Here we are.

